        "content": {
          "descriptor": {
            "type": "tagname",
            "key": "div",
            "props": {},
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tagname",
                "key": "@@standfirst",
                "props": {},
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "A First Nations mother of five repeatedly begged prison officials for her medications and was discharged from hospital after a suicide attempt without a mental health review, a coronial inquest heard today. The inquest will look at whether the healthcare she received met community standards."
